Held pending owner decision — LUXUPT-74.

`dev` is ~120 commits ahead of origin/dev and is NOT being pushed, for two reasons:

1. The pre-push hook (gitleaks over full history) blocks it. History on `dev` was scrubbed
   on 2026-09-05 and is clean, but `main` still serves the un-scrubbed history — two of the
   original leak commits (fa2a5cb, b0cac0b) are already published there. Pushing `dev`
   without a decision on `main` leaves the repo half-scrubbed.

2. Pushing rewritten history to a PUBLIC repo is a force-push: every SHA changed, so anyone
   with a clone must re-clone. That is the owner's call, not the agent's, and it has been
   raised (LUXUPT-74, state on_hold, waiting_on the owner).

Pre-scrub backup mirror: /tmp/luxupt-prescrub-backup.git (at abff6e2) — ephemeral, move it
somewhere durable if it is still wanted.

Clear this file once LUXUPT-74 is decided and the push happens.
